course: dictionary
lesson: 315
title: Andean: a word about place
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Andean is an adjective, a describing word. It tells you where something comes from. The Andes are a long chain of mountains along the west of South America, so Andean means "of the Andes" or "from the Andes".
explain: Read the words around it. «The Andean condor has wings about 3 metres across and glides on rising air.» Condor is a bird, and Andean tells you which kind of condor: the one from the mountains.
explain: The word can also be a noun: an Andean is a person from the Andes. «Andean peoples knew that cinchona bark helped with fever» shows people, not just things, who belong to the Andes.
fact: Andean describes the Andes, the long chain of mountains along the west of South America.
fact: «Andean» can also mean people from there, such as an Andean or Andeans.
fact: «The Inca Empire was an Andean civilisation» means the Inca were a people of the Andes.
fact: Andean countries include Peru, Bolivia, Ecuador, Chile, Colombia and Argentina.
fact: «Quinine» came from the bark of the cinchona tree, which Andean peoples knew about.
exercise: In «The Andean condor glides on rising air», what does Andean tell you? | A bird that lives under the sea | A bird from the Sahara desert | A bird with no wings | *A bird from the Andes mountains in South America
exercise: Which of these is NOT an Andean country? | *Japan | Bolivia | Chile | Peru
exercise: «Andean farmers grow potatoes and quinoa on terraces.» Who are Andean farmers? | Farmers who fish in the Pacific | *Farmers who work in the Andes mountain region | Farmers who only grow apples in England | Farmers who keep camels in a desert
test: In «The Inca Empire was an Andean civilisation», what does Andean mean? | Belonging to the Andes region | Very old | Belonging to a large city | *Belonging to the Andes region, meaning the mountains of South America
test: «Quinine was known to Andean peoples and became the main medicine for malaria.» What is an Andean person? | A person who lives on an island | A person who lives on a farm in England | *A person from the Andes mountains of South America | A person who sells medicine
exam: Which word in «Andean animals include llamas, alpacas, vicunas and the Andean condor» is an adjective describing where the animal lives? | Condor | *Andean | Animals | Llamas
